    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102801" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τειχ-έω</span></b> , used by <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
		</span></i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τειχίζω</span> (which he also
		has), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>build walls</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.99
			</span></i>, al.: c. acc. cogn., 
